<title>USA: Everest Re names Thomas Gallagher president.</title>
<headline>Everest Re names Thomas Gallagher president.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, N.J. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Everest Reinsurance Holdings Inc said Monday it has named Thomas Gallagher president and chief operating officer of the company and its subsidiary, Everest Reinsurance Co.</p>
<p>Gallagher succeeds Vincent Taranto as president. Taranto remains chairman and chief executive. The chief operating officer's position is newly created, a company spokesman said.</p>
